                                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#questionOne" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="questionOne">What is included in the ecommerce website package?</button>
                                </h3>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse show" id="questionOne" aria-labelledby="headingOne" data-bs-parent="#faq">
                                    <div class="accordion-body fs-sm">The ecommerce website package includes a unique and interactive website design with your business branding, a product catalog, online payment integration with M-Pesa and other gateways, shipping and inventory management tools, a dedicated management portal, and a domain name for your business (e.g. business.com).</div>
