                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="questionTwo" aria-labelledby="headingTwo" data-bs-parent="#faq">
                                    <div class="accordion-body fs-sm">The website is delivered within 72 hours after the initial video consultation meeting to discuss your business requirements.</div>
