                                    <div class="accordion-body fs-sm">The website comes integrated with M-Pesa for receiving payments directly to your mobile money account. We also support integration with other popular gateways like PayPal and Stripe to give your customers more payment options.</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item bg-light">
