                                </h3>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="questionFour" aria-labelledby="headingFour" data-bs-parent="#faq">
                                    <div class="accordion-body fs-sm">Yes, comprehensive training and guidance is provided to ensure you can effectively use all the features of the management portal to manage your products, orders, inventory, customer communications, view reports and handle payments.</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="accordion-item bg-light">
                                <h3 class="accordion-header" id="headingFive">
