                                </h3>
                                <div class="accordion-collapse collapse" id="questionFive" aria-labelledby="headingFive" data-bs-parent="#faq">
                                    <div class="accordion-body fs-sm">There is a one-time setup fee of KES 20,000 for building the ecommerce website. After that, there is a recurring monthly fee of KES 2,000 which covers website hosting, maintenance, support, security and any future updates. The first monthly payment of KES 2,000 is free.</div>
                                </div>
